%% ZTFA — system architecture (HLD §3 Figure 1)
graph LR
    subgraph TRUSTED[Trusted Zone — Client Domain]
        IoT[IoT Sensor<br/>MQTT stream] -->|labeled<br/>+ unlabeled| Client[Client Node<br/>PyTorch + CKKS engine<br/>★ secret key lives ONLY here ★]
        Client --> Inference[Inference runtime<br/>activity prediction]
        Client --> LocalRPC[Local-RPC<br/>127.0.0.1:7000+i]
        LocalRPC --> Portal[Portal UI<br/>Next.js + RainbowKit]
        Wallet[Client Wallet<br/>commit + fee tx] --> Chain
    end

    subgraph UNTRUSTED[Untrusted — Aggregator]
        Aggregator[Federated Aggregator<br/>FastAPI<br/>NO secret keys]
        Aggregator --> Homo[Homomorphic FedAvg<br/>c_sum = Σ c_i]
        Homo --> Prover[Groth16 Prover<br/>rapidsnark / snarkjs]
        Aggregator --> Storage[Postgres + MinIO]
    end

    subgraph LEDGER[Public Ledger]
        Chain[FederationRound.sol<br/>+ Verifier.sol<br/>~280k gas verify]
    end

    Client -->|encrypted weights c_i| Aggregator
    Aggregator -->|c_sum| Client
    Wallet -->|H_i + fee| Chain
    Aggregator -->|π + H_agg| Chain

    classDef trusted fill:#1e3a5f,stroke:#6c8eff,color:#fff
    classDef untrusted fill:#5f1e1e,stroke:#ff6c6c,color:#fff
    classDef ledger fill:#1e5f3a,stroke:#6cff8e,color:#fff
    class TRUSTED trusted
    class UNTRUSTED untrusted
    class LEDGER ledger
